  "murimblock.guide.realms.text": "Each Murim rank holds a cultivation realm of nine stages. Fill the dantian, then win the breakthrough trial to climb a stage.",
  "murimblock.guide.meridians": "Meridians",
  "murimblock.guide.meridians.text": "Twelve meridians open one after another for Qi, in the order Qi flows through them. Each one improves how your Qi flows. Joining the Ren and Du vessels forms the Small Heavenly Circuit.",
