  "murimblock.old_master.greet": "So, you finally look inward. Sit with me a while. The Qi listens better here than out in the noise of the world.",
  "murimblock.old_master.who": "A name belongs to the living. I was a master once, until the demon of my own heart cut me down. What remained of me took shelter in your dantian. Old Master will do.",
  "murimblock.old_master.place": "Your inner world. Every stone and petal is your own Qi given shape. Nothing here can be broken, and nothing here can kill you. Train without fear.",
  "murimblock.old_master.grow": "Hm. Let me look at you... %s",
  "murimblock.old_master.trial": "At the peak of every realm, your doubts take your face and stand in your way. Defeat that demon and the next realm opens. Fall, and part of your Qi scatters. Do not seek it before you are ready.",
